    "answer": {
      "short": "Segments in table order: sedan $54\\%$, people mover $12\\%$, station wagon $20\\%$, four-wheel drive $14\\%$.",
      "worked": "$$\\text{Total sold}=540+120+200+140=1000.$$\nUse an overall bar length of $10\\text{ cm}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Sedan length}&=\\frac{540}{1000}\\times10=5.4\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{People mover length}&=\\frac{120}{1000}\\times10=1.2\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Station wagon length}&=\\frac{200}{1000}\\times10=2\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Four-wheel drive length}&=\\frac{140}{1000}\\times10=1.4\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\nDraw a rectangle with these consecutive segment lengths and label each category.",
